      "source": [
        "### 5B. Multinomial Naive Bayes\n",
        "\n",
        "> Assumes features are **non-negative counts or frequencies**.  \n",
        "> We use `MinMaxScaler` here to ensure values are ≥ 0 (MultinomialNB requires this)."
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": null,
      "id": "multinomial-nb",
      "metadata": {
        "id": "multinomial-nb"
